# The proofs in finishing/reports/ are generated whole from manuscript/ on every
# rebuild. The PDF git already treats as binary; the HTML it would not, and a
# megabyte of regenerated markup diffed line by line buries the source changes
# in the same commit and inflates every diff-based review of the branch -- the
# cost D-068 named for the PDF, which D-072 restored knowing it. Marking them
# undiffable is the part of that cost this repository can actually pay down.
#
# -merge as well as -diff: a generated file has no sensible three-way merge. On
# a conflict, rebuild with finishing/tools/build_proof.sh rather than resolve.
finishing/reports/whole-book-proof_*.pdf   -diff -merge linguist-generated
finishing/reports/whole-book-proof_*.html  -diff -merge linguist-generated
# The persona-device record is one binary archive by design (2026-09-05).
persona-device-files_*.zip                 -diff -merge
